  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You were born to Saltan parents. You are short and stout; with a strong, hale body with brighter shades of color for your hair. Your tough body is particularly resistant to poisons, and your eyes are adjusted to the dark. You gain low-light vision; if you gain low-light vision from another source you gain darkvision instead. Whenever you succeed a saving throw against an effect with a Poison trait, you treat your outcome as one step higher.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special:</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you are using the Golarion Ancestries rule, you can select any Dwarf ancestry feats (at your GM’s discretion).</span></p>"
